NOTICE -- what the license above does and does not cover.

This repository is an independent, unofficial implementation of the game
*Turing Complete*. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or produced by
LevelHead, it is not an official product, and it is not intended for commercial
distribution. The design spec makes this a hard constraint on the project, and
README.md carries the full statement, including exactly what was and was not
copied from the original.

The MIT license above covers this project's source code and the game's own
in-game text. It does NOT cover two third-party research documents at the
repository root: `GAME_REFERENCE.md` and `GAME_RESEARCH_2026-10-03.md`. Both are
compendia *about* the game, both reproduce passages of the original's text
(including dialogue and the official store description), and both are committed
here as provenance for this replica's design rather than as content the game
ships. Nothing under `src/` reads them, and no image of the original's art is
included anywhere in this repository. Those documents remain the property of
their authors; `RESEARCH.md` records what each one is and which version of the
game it documents.
